{"abstract":"The article discusses the way in which racism and solidarity informed leftist and radical politics in early-20th-century Los Angeles, California. Focus is given to the ways in which the Left's understanding of race brought about support for cultural affinity within the state's labor organizing and anarchist movements, particularly those of the Industrial Workers of the World (IWW) labor organization.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Struthers, David"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-280524"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the boss has no color line race solidarity and a culture of affinity in los angeles and the borderlands 000000001907 000000001915","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-280524","identifier":[{"id":"84885025013","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["cbs-363a411f-37d8-4e20-9209-c969066e757b"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-97483AB2656D4D3E7F8B7A72A51F7A20"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of International Business Communication"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"David","key":"strutherspau","last":"Struthers","name":"Struthers, David","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1353/jsr.2013.0023","issn":["19301189","19301197"],"issn_org":["19301189"],"issue":"2","journal":"Journal for the Study of Radicalism","pages":"61-92","publisher":"Dr. Rudolf Habelt","status":"p","title":"Journal for the Study of Radicalism","volume":"7"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-363a411f-37d8-4e20-9209-c969066e757b"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"“The Boss Has No Color Line” : Race, Solidarity, and a Culture of Affinity in Los Angeles and the Borderlands, 1907–1915","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-280524","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
